# Invalid-placement feedback position and duration

Move invalid-placement messages lower on the screen and shorten their display period.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Road and building validation messages appear towards the bottom of the Board without covering bottom controls.
- [ ] Each message remains visible for 1.5 seconds, then dismisses automatically.
- [ ] A later invalid attempt replaces and restarts the active message deterministically.
- [ ] Board editing and construction-plan placement use the same presentation behavior.
- [ ] Existing exact validation copy remains unchanged.
- [ ] Timing logic is cancellable and cannot dismiss a newer message early.
- [ ] Focused UI checks pass on a functioning simulator.

## Verification

- Add deterministic state/timing coverage where possible and UI coverage for placement and automatic dismissal.
